<line x1="-38.1" y1="22" x2="-38.1" y2="-22" stroke="#0f172a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<line x1="-32.6" y1="14" x2="-32.6" y2="-14" stroke="#0f172a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<line x1="-38.1" y1="-22" x2="0" y2="-44" stroke="#0f172a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<line x1="0" y1="-44" x2="0" y2="-77" stroke="#0f172a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<text x="-5.8" y="-88" dominant-baseline="central" text-anchor="start" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="#1d4ed8" stroke="#f8fafc" stroke-width="4" paint-order="stroke" stroke-linejoin="round">N<tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">+</tspan><tspan dy="6">​</tspan></text>
<line x1="8.1" y1="-95.9" x2="28" y2="-107.4" stroke="#0f172a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<line x1="10.9" y1="-91.1" x2="30.8" y2="-102.6" stroke="#0f172a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<text x="32.3" y="-110" dominant-baseline="central" text-anchor="start" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="#b91c1c" stroke="#f8fafc" stroke-width="4" paint-order="stroke" stroke-linejoin="round">O</text>
<line x1="-9.5" y1="-93.5" x2="-29.4" y2="-105" stroke="#0f172a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<text x="-47.9" y="-110" dominant-baseline="central" text-anchor="start" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="#b91c1c" stroke="#f8fafc" stroke-width="4" paint-order="stroke" stroke-linejoin="round">O<tspan dy="-6" font-size="12">−</tspan><tspan dy="6">​</tspan></text>
</svg>', 'The nitro group is strongly electron-withdrawing (–M, –I): it deactivates the ring and destabilises the arenium ions from ortho/para attack (positive charge lands next to the N^+). Meta attack avoids this, so the second NO_2 enters at the meta position, giving 1,3-dinitrobenzene (m-dinitrobenzene).', 'C');
SET @q = LAST_INSERT_ID();
INSERT INTO question_options (question_id, label, option_text) VALUES (@q, 'A', '1,2-Dinitrobenzene');
